  << /ActualText (Games with strong social features\054 like team\055based matches or voice chat with friends\054 are harder to put down than games played alone\056 Players rarely decide to stop on their own\056 If friends are still online\054 it\047s hard to leave first\054 and a friend asking you to stay longer is often enough to keep someone playing who already wanted to stop\056)
